"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122120325309101378&title=%09%F0%9F%97%B3%EF%B8%8FIt%E2%80%99s+Election+Day%21%F0%9F%97%B3%EF%B8%8FThank+you+for+the+conversations%2C+questions%2C+encouragement+and+support+throughout+this+campaign.+Today%2C+the+decision+belongs+to+you.Polls+are+open+7+a.m.+to+7+p.m.+If+you+aren%E2%80%99t+registered%2C+you+can+register+at+the+polls+today.I+chose+to+run+because+I+believe+in+a+strong+future+for+Wyoming+and+the+communities+we+call+home.I+would+be+honored+to+earn+your+vote+for+Wyoming+Senate+District+21.Please+vote+today%2C+Tuesday%2C+August+18.+%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122120373765101378&title=%09The+polls+are+closed.Whatever+tonight+brings%2C+I%E2%80%99m+deeply+grateful+to+everyone+who+voted%2C+volunteered%2C+contributed%2C+opened+a+door%2C+attended+an+event%2C+asked+a+question%2C+or+simply+took+the+time+to+have+a+conversation+with+me+during+this+campaign.And+to+the+people+who+have+worked+beside+me+these+past+several+months%3A+thank+you.+There+is+no+way+to+adequately+describe+what+your+time%2C+encouragement+and+confidence+have+meant+to+me.Now+we+wait+for+the+results.+%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122120396919101378&title=%09Thank+you%2C+Senate+District+21.I+am+deeply+grateful+for+the+trust+you+have+placed+in+me+tonight.This+campaign+began+with+a+belief+that+the+people+who+live+here+should+have+a+meaningful+voice+in+the+decisions+that+shape+our+communities+and+our+state.+Over+the+past+several+months%2C+you+opened+your+doors%2C+shared+your+concerns%2C+challenged+me+with+hard+questions%2C+and+told+me+what+you+hope+Wyoming+can+become.I+heard+you.+And+I+will+keep+hearing+you.Thank+you+to+everyone+who+volunteered%2C+contributed%2C+encouraged+me%2C+and+worked+so+hard+to+make+this+possible.+Thank+you+to+everyone+who+voted%E2%80%94whether+you+voted+for+me+or+not%E2%80%94for+participating+in+the+process+and+caring+about+the+future+of+our+communities.Tonight+is+not+the+end+of+that+responsibility.+It+is+the+beginning+of+a+new+one.Thank+you+for+your+trust.+I+will+work+hard+to+earn+it+every+day.%23butcherforwyoming+%23always+%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122120774835101378&title=%09A+friend+shared+with+me+today+a+photo+of+an+offensive+message+that+was+written+in+chalk+outside+my+opponent%26%23039%3Bs+home+around+Election+Day.+This+is+the+first+I+have+heard+about+this+incident.Ken+and+I+had+real+differences+during+this+campaign%2C+but+we+were+cordial+and+respectful+toward+one+another+throughout+it.+I+appreciated+that.During+this+campaign%2C+I+made+a+pledge+to+treat+those+who+disagree+with+me+as+neighbors%2C+not+enemies.+I+meant+it+then%2C+and+I+mean+it+now.What+happened+at+Ken%26%23039%3Bs+home+isn%26%23039%3Bt+okay.+Political+disagreement+does+not+justify+vulgarity+or+disrespect+toward+someone+or+their+family.I+don%26%23039%3Bt+know+who+was+responsible%2C+and+I+won%26%23039%3Bt+speculate.+But+the+standard+shouldn%26%23039%3Bt+depend+on+whose+candidate+won+or+lost.We+can+disagree.+We+can+argue+our+case.+We+can+vote+differently.+And+when+it%26%23039%3Bs+over%2C+we%26%23039%3Bre+still+neighbors.+%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122121053241101378&title=%09It+may+still+be+August%2C+but+apparently+it%26%23039%3Bs+back-to-school+season+for+me%2C+too.January+will+be+here+before+we+know+it%2C+and+I%26%23039%3Bm+trying+to+make+good+use+of+the+time+between+now+and+then+to+prepare+for+the+job+I%26%23039%3Bve+been+nominated+to+do.I%26%23039%3Bm+following+the+legislative+committees+that+meet+between+sessions.+A+lot+of+that+work+grows+out+of+the+last+legislative+session.+Some+issues+needed+more+study%2C+some+questions+weren%26%23039%3Bt+resolved%2C+and+some+things+simply+need+a+closer+look+before+lawmakers+take+them+up+again.+Those+committees+are+also+developing+proposals+that+may+come+before+us+in+2027.I%26%23039%3Bm+following+work+on+property+taxes%2C+education+and+school+finance%2C+elections%2C+energy%2C+health+care%2C+state+spending+and+local+government.+That+means+reading+committee+materials+and+recent+legislation%2C+looking+at+what%26%23039%3Bs+been+tried+before+and+talking+with+current+legislators+and+others+who+know+these+issues+well.There+is+no+shortage+of+reading+material.+%F0%9F%99%82I%26%23039%3Bm+also+building+the+systems+I+would+use+to+evaluate+legislation%2C+track+bills+and+amendments+and+follow+fiscal+impacts.+Just+as+important%2C+I+don%26%23039%3Bt+want+what+I+hear+from+constituents+to+simply+land+in+an+inbox+somewhere.+I+want+to+connect+those+conversations+to+the+issues+I%26%23039%3Bm+working+on+and+be+able+to+report+back+on+what+happened.The+primary+is+behind+us%2C+but+the+questions+Wyoming+Republicans+have+been+asking+about+spending%2C+taxes%2C+property+rights%2C+elections%2C+individual+liberty+and+the+proper+role+of+government+are+still+very+much+in+front+of+us.+Those+issues+don%26%23039%3Bt+belong+to+one+candidate+or+one+caucus.We%26%23039%3Bre+not+always+going+to+agree+on+the+answer.+That%26%23039%3Bs+just+reality+when+you%26%23039%3Bre+dealing+with+complex%2C+layered+issues+and+systems.+If+I%26%23039%3Bm+elected+in+November%2C+my+job+will+be+to+understand+the+problem+we%26%23039%3Bre+trying+to+solve+and+what+the+Constitution+and+current+law+require%2C+then+look+hard+at+the+costs%2C+consequences+and+whether+a+proposal+actually+makes+things+better.Over+the+next+several+months%2C+I%26%23039%3Bll+share+some+of+what+I%26%23039%3Bm+following+and+working+through%2C+including+some+of+the+questions+I+have+along+the+way.+And+please+keep+telling+me+what+you%26%23039%3Bre+seeing+and+thinking%2C+too.+%09%09",
"https://linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122121599013101378&title=%09%E2%80%9CWe+should+all+be+asking+the+question%E2%80%A6+%E2%80%98What+am+I+doing+to+make+my+community+better%3F%E2%80%99%E2%80%9DYears+ago%2C+when+I+worked+for+the+Wyoming+Department+of+Transportation%2C+I+spent+quite+a+bit+of+time+in+Newcastle+as+WYDOT+prepared+to+reconstruct+Main+Street.+My+job+was+public+outreach+%E2%80%94+talking+with+residents+and+business+owners%2C+gathering+their+input+about+how+the+street+should+function+and+what+kinds+of+improvements+and+amenities+they+wanted+to+see+as+part+of+the+project.One+of+my+first+projects+after+joining+WYDOT+involved+very+similar+work+right+here+in+Sheridan%2C+as+Main+Street+was+being+revitalized.+Those+projects+gave+me+a+front-row+seat+to+just+how+much+people+care+about+the+places+they+call+home+%E2%80%94+and+how+important+it+is+that+they+have+a+meaningful+voice+when+decisions+are+being+made+about+those+places.What+I+remember+most+is+how+much+people+cared+about+getting+it+right+for+their+communities.So+it+was+especially+nice+to+see+that+video+all+these+years+later+and+see+a+downtown+that+continues+to+be+active%2C+attractive+and+very+much+a+part+of+the+life+of+Newcastle.Communities+don%E2%80%99t+become+vibrant+because+of+one+project%2C+one+organization+or+one+person.+They+become+vibrant+because%2C+over+many+years%2C+people+keep+showing+up%2C+listening+to+one+another+and+investing+their+time+and+energy+in+the+places+they+call+home.That%E2%80%99s+certainly+true+here+in+Sheridan+County%2C+too.And+it%E2%80%99s+a+good+reminder+for+me+as+I+prepare+to+serve+in+the+Senate%3A+the+best+decisions+start+with+understanding+what+a+community+values%2C+making+sure+people+have+a+meaningful+voice+and+working+to+turn+that+vision+into+results.+%09%09",
